  "body": "A beautiful, renovated, character home with modern comforts and 731m² of freehold land set on a corner site giving dual access to the property, what more could you want?\r\n\r\nThis beautifully renovated 1920s bungalow has so much more to offer than meets the eye. Come inside and discover a fabulous family home, ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\n10 REASONS TO COME AND SEE IT:\r\n- 731M² FREEHOLD CORNER SITE – space, privacy and generous lawns.\r\n- NORTH-FACING AND ELEVATED – capturing beautiful all-day sunshine.\r\n- HEATED SWIMMING POOL – enjoy the swimming season for longer.\r\n- SUPERB INDOOR-OUTDOOR LIVING – private poolside terrace, perfect for entertaining.\r\n- BEAUTIFULLY RENOVATED – timeless 1920s character meets contemporary living.\r\n- 4 BEDROOMS AND 2 BATHROOMS – including a private downstairs master suite.\r\n- STYLISH MODERN KITCHEN – open-plan living and dining.\r\n- NEW ROOF – with a 15-year warranty on materials and a 5-year workmanship warranty from installation.\r\n- DOUBLE GARAGING AND DUAL ACCESS – plus excellent storage.\r\n- PRIME DEVONPORT LOCATION – on bus route, close to schools, beaches, sports facilities and village life.\r\n\r\nTHE RENOVATIONS ARE DONE. THE POOL IS WAITING. SUMMER IS JUST AROUND THE CORNER!\r\n\r\nWhether you've been watching this property online or have already visited, we'd love to welcome you through for another look.\r\n\r\nJOIN US AT OUR TWI-LIGHT OPEN HOME THIS WEDNESDAY BETWEEN 5:30 AND 6:00PM OR ON SATURDAY AND SUNDAY BETWEEN 1:00 AND 1:30PM.\r\n\r\nPrice by Negotiation. All genuine offers will be presented.",
